<title>UK: Bullough sells Reznor to Thomas &amp; Betts.</title>
<headline>Bullough sells Reznor to Thomas &amp; Betts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bullough Plc said on Monday that it has sold its Reznor industrial warm air heating business to Thomas &amp; Betts Corp for around 9.75 million stg in cash.</p>
<p>Thomas &amp; Betts, who already own Reznor in the U.S., are buying Reznor companies in Belgium, UK, Germany and France.  </p>
<p>Bullough also announced the sale of Hago products Ltd, its consumer and industrial wire products business, for around 1.0 million stg to Belldray, which is owned by U.S. firm KRUG International Corp.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
